WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.760
Previously on Hammerless...

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.320
A Hammer Jam with no hammer.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.240
A village where everyone is a suspect.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.640
And after a long investigation,

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.040
more questions than answers.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.920
What was Barbarian trying to tell us?

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.200
Where was P.E.K.K.A in all of this?

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.680
And who bathes with a hog?

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.600
Perhaps a someone with impeccable timing
would step up,

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.280
solve this mystery,

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.080
and save Hammer Jam.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.000
I have arrived.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.640
I heard you might be missing...

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:42.920
this!

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.680
Oh. The hammer!

00:00:57.840 --> 00:00:59.960
Hammer Jam is saved.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.760
So it was sitting right in front of us
the whole time?

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.160
Another case cracked. 
All in a day's work.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.320
Who is that guy?
Oh.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:19.360
The hammer has been unjammed.
Hammer jam is saved.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.400
Let the upgrading begin.

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:24.760
CLASH OF CLANS

